# INFERNO alone, the window closed at 2 s (Windows' End Task, the web
# page's tab closed: WM_CLOSE, then WM_DESTROY). WM_CLOSE posts the
# time-out's report, (5 lives, 500): a win with a life left (BUGS.md H4).
# `--fix all` (`inferno_close_forfeits`) makes it a loss, reported with
# INFERNO's points as a lost game is (`inferno_loss_reports`):
# g_score - 1000 = -1000.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame inferno --headless --ms 3000 --input tools/play/inferno-close.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame inferno --headless --ms 3000 --fix all --input tools/play/inferno-close.input
2000 close
2500 result won 500 | lost -1000
